WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.146
"Risks of NAD+ Boosting Supplements"

00:00:07.254 --> 00:00:08.640
Most of the reported
side effects

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:13.080
for NAD+ precursors,
like NAM, NR, and NMN,

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:14.960
are relatively rare and minor,

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.760
for example, diarrhea,
nausea, rashes, hot flashes,

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:19.200
and leg cramps.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.680
Both NR and NMN
raise NAM levels,

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:25.560
so may share
in the same concerns

00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:29.200
regarding sirtuin inhibition,
methyl depletion,

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.680
and potential adverse effects
of NAM breakdown products.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.520
Another theoretical concern
of NAD+ boosting

00:00:36.520 --> 00:00:38.360
is the exacerbation
of infections

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:40.760
by a group of bacteria
called Haemophilus

00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:43.280
(from the Greek
meaning "blood loving,"

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:45.480
though can also cause
infections of the lungs,

00:00:45.480 --> 00:00:48.240
brain, throat,
flesh, and joints).

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.640
Haemophilus bacteria lack
the ability to make NAD+,

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.440
so rely on host levels,

00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:55.920
raising the possibility
that higher blood levels

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:59.920
might worsen the disease course
of infected individuals.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.880
Ironically,
elevated NAD+ levels

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.960
may also fuel
immune system overreaction

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:08.560
in cases of auto-immune
and inflammatory disease.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:12.000
When fully activated,
the immune system is voracious.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.960
The immune reaction
to a blood infection

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:18.040
or extensive burns can burn
4,000 calories a day,

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:21.080
approximating military training
in the Arctic.

00:01:21.080 --> 00:01:23.800
Since NAD+ is used by cells
to produce energy,

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:25.200
it's no surprise that we find

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.360
the primary NAD+
synthesizing enzyme

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:29.840
strongly upregulated

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:32.160
in tissues
that are actively inflamed.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:35.840
For example,
the enzyme NAMPT is elevated

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:39.360
in colonoscopy biopsies
taken from inflamed areas

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:42.240
in patients with
inflammatory bowel disease,

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.440
and higher levels
are correlated

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:46.720
with greater disease severity.

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:50.280
So, for those suffering from
chronic autoimmune diseases,

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:52.240
such as rheumatoid arthritis,

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:54.400
NAD+ boosting
could potentially have

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.040
a "profound negative impact."

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:00.000
This explains
why tamping down NAD+

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.120
with NAMPT inhibitors
has been shown

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:06.800
to ameliorate colitis
and arthritis in mice,

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.320
but this has yet
to be tested in people.

00:02:09.320 --> 00:02:12.040
Such NAD+ depleting drugs
have, however,

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:14.680
been used in cancer patients.

00:02:14.680 --> 00:02:18.760
Malignancy is another heavily
energy-consuming process.

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:22.040
NAD+ may, therefore,
have a tumor-promoting effect

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:24.480
by promoting cancer cell growth
and spread.

00:02:24.480 --> 00:02:28.000
For example, NAMPT,
the NAD+-forming enzyme,

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.360
is highly expressed
in cancerous brain tumors

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:34.040
and correlates with
decreased patient survival.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.240
This has led to attempts
to use NAD+-depleting therapies

00:02:37.240 --> 00:02:40.440
to try to starve
cancer progression,

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:43.240
but this approach is confounded
by rapid onset injury

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.560
to another
energy-intensive tissue,

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:49.720
the retina,
risking blindness.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.520
Giving NMN to mice
with pancreatic cancer

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:55.120
accelerates the progression
of the cancer,

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:57.960
thought due to the aggravation
of inflammation.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:01.200
The researchers conclude that
consumers of NAD+ supplements

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:04.320
must "balance the advantageous
anti-ageing effects

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:09.000
with the potential detrimental
pro-tumorigenic side effects."

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.680
Perhaps this explains
why the best NAD+ boosters

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:13.120
have ever been able to do

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:16.760
is increase mice lifespan
by five percent.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:18.320
On the other hand,
as you'll remember,

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:22.040
NAM successfully prevented
human skin cancers

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:24.160
and has been found
to reduce the incidence

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:26.520
of a variety
of carcinogen-induced tumors

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:27.840
in rodents.

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:30.280
The disparate results
may in part be due

00:03:30.280 --> 00:03:32.840
to the disparate impact
sirtuin activation

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:34.520
may have on different cancers.

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.600
Sirtuin activity
can be overexpressed

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:38.000
in some cancers

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.920
(like thyroid carcinomas
and lung metastasis)

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:42.280
but reduced in others

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:44.800
(like brain, bladder, prostate,
and ovarian tumors).

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.000
The bottom line
is that particular caution

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.520
should be used
for NAD+-boosting supplements

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.920
by those with cancer,

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:54.920
or a personal or strong
family history of cancer,

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:57.720
and perhaps also by those
with inflammatory disorders

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.680
and certain active infections.

